msgctxt "doeAnalysis|"
msgid "Method"
msgstr "Metode"

msgctxt "doeAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Specify the order in which the predictors are entered into the model. A "
"block of one or more predictors represents one step in the hierarchy. Note "
"that the present release does not allow for more than one block. The "
"backward and forward method are based on model AIC."
msgstr ""
"Tentukan urutan prediktor mana dimasukkan ke dalam model. Blok dari satu "
"atau lebih prediktor merepresentasikan satu langkah di hirarki. Dicatat "
"bahwa rilis penampilan tidak mengizinkan untuk lebih dari satu blok. Metode "
"mundur dan maju berdasarkan model AIC."

msgctxt "doeAnalysis|"
msgid "Enter"
msgstr "Masukkan"

msgctxt "doeAnalysis|"
msgid "All predictors are entered into the model simultaneously."
msgstr "Semua prediktor dimasukkan ke dalam model secara bersamaan."

msgctxt "doeAnalysis|"
msgid "Backward"
msgstr "Mundur"

msgctxt "doeAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Starting with the full model, predictors are removed sequentially based on "
"AIC."
msgstr ""
"Mulai dengan model penuh, prediktor dihapus secara sekuensial berdasarkan "
"AIC."

msgctxt "doeAnalysis|"
msgid "Forward"
msgstr "Maju"

msgctxt "doeAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Starting with the intercept-only model, predictors are entered sequentially "
"based on AIC."
msgstr ""
"Mulai dengan model hanya intersep, prediktor dimasukkan secara sekuensial "
"berdasarkan AIC."

msgctxt "doeAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Specify the order in which the predictors are entered into the model. A "
