msgctxt "Description|"
msgid "Multivariate Control Charts"
msgstr "Multivariasikan Bagan Kontrol"

msgctxt "multivariateControlCharts|"
msgid "Variables"
msgstr "Variabel"

msgctxt "multivariateControlCharts|"
msgid ""
"Two or more continuous quality characteristics to monitor jointly using a "
"Hotelling T² chart."
msgstr ""
"Dua atau lebih karakteristik kualitas berkelanjutan untuk memantau bersama "
"menggunakan bagan T² Hotelling."

msgctxt "multivariateControlCharts|"
msgid "Timestamp (optional)"
msgstr "Stempel waktu (opsional)"

msgctxt "multivariateControlCharts|"
msgid ""
"Optional column used as x-axis labels (e.g., a timestamp or row identifier)."
msgstr ""
"Kolom opsional digunakan sebagai label sumbu-x (cth., stempel waktu atau "
"pengidentifikasi baris)."

msgctxt "multivariateControlCharts|"
msgid "Stage"
msgstr "Tahap"

msgctxt "multivariateControlCharts|"
msgid ""
"Optional grouping variable that splits the data into a training phase (Phase "
"I) and a test phase (Phase II). Control limits are estimated from the "
"training phase and applied to the test phase for anomaly detection."
msgstr ""
"Variabel penggrupan opsional yang memisahkan data menjadi fase pelatihan "
"(Fase I) dan fase pengujian (Fase II). Batas kontrol diestimasikan dari fase "
"pelatihan dan diterapkan ke fase pengujian untuk deteksi anomali."

msgctxt "multivariateControlCharts|"
msgid "Training phase level"
msgstr "Tingkat fase pelatihan"

msgctxt "multivariateControlCharts|"
msgid ""
"Select which level of the stage variable represents the training (in-"
"control) phase. Control limits and the covariance matrix are estimated from "
"this phase only."
msgstr ""
"Pilih mana tingkat dari variabel tahap merepresentasikan fase pelatihan "
"(dalam kontrol). Batas kontrol dan matriks kovarians diestimasikan hanya "
"dari fase ini."

msgctxt "multivariateControlCharts|"
msgid "Control Chart"
msgstr "Bagan Kontrol"

msgctxt "multivariateControlCharts|"
msgid "Automatic confidence level: (1 - 0.0027)ᵖ"
msgstr "Tingkat kepercayaan otomatis: (1 - 0.0027)ᵖ"

msgctxt "multivariateControlCharts|"
msgid ""
"When checked, confidence level is automatically set to (1 - 0.0027)^p, where "
"p is the number of variables. This is the standard Bonferroni-adjusted level "
"for multivariate charts."
msgstr ""
"Ketika dicentang, tingkat kepercayaan secara otomatis diatur ke (1 - "
"0.0027)^p, di mana p adalah jumlah variabel. Ini adalah tingkat disesuaikan "
"Bonferroni standar untuk bagan multivariat."

msgctxt "multivariateControlCharts|"
msgid "Confidence level"
msgstr "Tingkat kepercayaan"

msgctxt "multivariateControlCharts|"
msgid ""
"Custom confidence level for the control limits. Only active when automatic "
"confidence level is unchecked."
msgstr ""
"Tingkat kepercayaan kustom untuk batas kontrol. Hanya aktif ketika tingkat "
"kepercayaan otomatis tidak dicentang."

msgctxt "multivariateControlCharts|"
msgid "Output"
msgstr "Luaran"

msgctxt "multivariateControlCharts|"
msgid "Variable centers"
msgstr "Kepusatan variabel"

msgctxt "multivariateControlCharts|"
msgid "Show the mean of each variable."
msgstr "Tampilkan rerata dari setiap variabel."

msgctxt "multivariateControlCharts|"
msgid "Covariance matrix"
msgstr "Matriks kovarians"

msgctxt "multivariateControlCharts|"
msgid "Show the sample covariance matrix of the selected variables."
msgstr "Tampilkan matriks kovarians sampel dari variabel terpilih."

msgctxt "multivariateControlCharts|"
msgid "T² values table"
msgstr "Tabel nilai T²"

msgctxt "multivariateControlCharts|"
msgid ""
"Show a table with the T² statistic for each observation, along with the UCL "
"and in/out-of-control status."
msgstr ""
"Tampilkan tabel dengan statistik T² untuk setiap observasi, bersamaan dengan "
"URL dan status dalam/luar kontrol."

msgctxt "multivariateControlCharts|"
msgid "Add T² values to data"
msgstr "Tambahkan nilai T² ke data"

msgctxt "multivariateControlCharts|"
msgid "Adds the computed Hotelling T² values as a new column in the dataset."
msgstr ""
"Menambahkan nilai T² Hotelling terhitung sebagai kolom baru di rangkaian "
"data."

msgctxt "multivariateControlCharts|"
msgid "Column name"
msgstr "Nama kolom"

msgctxt "multivariateControlCharts|"
msgid "e.g., tsq"
msgstr "mis., tsq"

msgctxt "multivariateControlCharts|"
msgid "Advanced Options"
msgstr "Opsi Lanjutan"

msgctxt "multivariateControlCharts|"
msgid "Plot color scheme"
msgstr "Skema warna diagram"

msgctxt "multivariateControlCharts|"
msgid "Standard (red/blue)"
msgstr "Standar (merah/biru)"

msgctxt "multivariateControlCharts|"
msgid "Colorblind-friendly (orange/blue)"
msgstr "Ramah buta warna (oranye/biru)"

msgctxt "multivariateControlCharts|"
msgid ""
"Choose colors for limits and out-of-control points. The colorblind-friendly "
"scheme uses orange instead of red."
msgstr ""
"Pilih warna untuk titik batas dan di luar kontrol. Skema ramah buta warna "
"menggunakan oranye alih-alih merah."

msgctxt "doeAnalysis|"
msgid "Stepwise"
msgstr "Bertahap"

msgctxt "doeAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Starting with the intercept-only model, predictors are entered or removed "
"sequentially based on AIC, combining both forward addition and backward "
"elimination at each step."
msgstr ""
"Memulai dengan model hanya intersep, prediktor dimasukkan atau dihapus "
"secara sekuensial berdasarkan AIC, mengombinasikan kedua tambahan maju dan "
"eliminasi mundur pada setiap langkah."

msgctxt "processCapabilityStudies|"
msgid "Z (ST) / Z (LT)"
msgstr "Z (ST) / (LT)"

msgctxt "processCapabilityStudies|"
msgid "Axis modifications"
msgstr "Modifikasi sumbu"

msgctxt "processCapabilityStudies|"
msgid "Thin x-axis labels"
msgstr "Label sumbu-x tipis"

msgctxt "processCapabilityStudies|"
msgid "Compress x-axis"
msgstr "Kompres sumbu-x"

msgctxt "msaGaugeRR|"
msgid "r&R Analysis of Variance table"
msgstr "Analisis r&R tabel Varians"

msgctxt "msaGaugeRR|"
msgid "Average chart by operator"
msgstr "Grafik rata-rata berdasarkan operator"

msgctxt "msaGaugeRRnonrep|"
msgid "r&R Analysis of Variance table"
msgstr "Analisis r&R tabel Varians"

msgctxt "processCapabilityStudies|"
msgid "Z.bench (ST) / Z.bench (LT)"
msgstr "Z.bench (ST) / Z.bench (LT)"

msgctxt "processCapabilityStudies|"
msgid ""
"Sigma level based on total defect probability across both specification "
"limits, as opposed to Z (ST)/Z (LT) which equal 3·Cpk/3·Ppk (distance to the "
"nearest bound)."
msgstr ""
"Tingkat sigma berdasarkan probabilits cacat total di kedua batas "
"spesifikasi, berbeda dengan Z (ST)/Z (LT) yang sama dengan 3·Cpk/3·Ppk "
"(jarak ke batas terdekat)."

msgctxt "processCapabilityStudies|"
msgid "Pooled"
msgstr "Dikumpul"
